  "description": "Rigorous engineering orchestrator ported from Lauren Tan's pstack (poteto-mode): reads your task, picks one of 23 playbooks (bug fix, feature, refactoring, perf, investigation, prototype, babysit, shipping, autonomous run, orchestrate, and more), routes to bundled procedures (how, why, architect, arena, swarm, interrogate, unslop, technical-writing, show-me-your-work, tdd, and others), and applies 24 engineering principles. Self-contained: no plugin install, no sibling skills required, works with any agent that reads skills.sh-format SKILL.md files. Use whenever a task needs rigor: nontrivial code changes, architecture decisions, debugging, reviews, PRs, long autonomous runs, or \"work like poteto\", \"poteto-mode\", \"pstack\".",
